  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You create a maelstrom of razor-sharp bone shards.</p><p>Choose a point within <strong>30 spaces</strong>. Each creature within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of that point takes <strong>1 Damage</strong> as you hurl a chunk of bone that explodes upon impact.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may make the bones of a corpse within <strong>30 spaces</strong> of you explode. If you do so, the damage inflicted by this spell is doubled.</p>",
